Security-Scripts Overview

1 - Security-Full-Diagnostic.ps1 - Runs a security baseline audit on the system, checking Microsoft Defender configuration, real-time protection status, and signature age, while highlighting vulnerabilities with direct fix recommendations.

2 - Security-Identity-Auditor.ps1 - Audits the local SAM database to identify privilege risks, flag accounts with long-term inactivity (stale users), map out members of the Local Administrators group, and verify local password policy strength.

3 - Security-Incident-Sniffer.ps1 - Conducts a rapid cyber forensics scan of Windows event logs to isolate security anomalies, tracking potential brute-force logon failures, suspicious event log clearance, and unauthorized removable USB storage insertions.
